{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Take heed, do not turn to iniquity, for you have chosen this</b> — that you take heed: it is better for you to choose Him in days of affliction, and the Place will exalt you."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {0 "Reading כי על זה as 'for you have chosen this' (Job 36:21); the comment parses זה as referring to the choice just mentioned, understanding the verse's זה as pointing to the recommended course."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:41.300747333Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}